Error [E0119]: `Ability` is a fact menu, not a type
  --> tests/ui/phantom_fact_menu_capability.jet:3:13
    |
  3 | fn audit(c: Ability) {
    |             ^^^^^^^
 Why: `Ability` names a fixed set of marker-argument values; it is never constructed as an ordinary value
 Fix: take `Abilities` (the rights value), or a rights list `[Right]`; inside a marker, write it in `#Abilities(...)`
